5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system based on facts. I'll check the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know if it's actually fair! I'll look at absences on the wall calendar and a fortnight's watch on kitchen use.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I'm worried about our harmony. I'll check the rows recorded in the house chat and the note left by the previous tenants.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the money! I'm picking bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts and the management office rate sheet and billing.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
