25,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes over an hour and a half. The outside firm requires us to tidy up before they even arrive.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It's not even! Some of us are barely here, and only a few people actually make the kitchen a mess.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Victoria,,Our chat history is full of reminders that lead to fights. The previous tenants tried permanent rooms and stopped speaking.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Rin,,"We're wasting money buying the same spray twice! Also, the management office has a set hourly rate for cleaners.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We all have different ideas of what ""clean"" means. And the bathroom grout gets dirty again in less than two weeks.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, if the grout fails that fast, a rota might just be a cycle of frustration.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if permanent rooms make people stop talking, we definitely shouldn't do that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. We need a solution that doesn't leave one person feeling burdened or resentful.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If we hire someone, we can just split the bill. It stops the ""who paid for the sponges"" fight.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with Rin. I don't want to guess if the room is actually clean or just ""done.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, the management office rate is 4,200 yen. We have to consider if that's sustainable for everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But if we do a rota, the people who don't cook still have to clean the kitchen. That's not fair.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"A rota still requires reminders, which we know leads to arguments in the chat.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Rin,,But we're already spending money on supplies haphazardly. A professional service might be more efficient.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to walk into the bathroom without feeling anxious.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The time investment is significant. If we can afford it, removing the labor removes the conflict.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm open to it if it means no one is stuck doing more than their share.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Victoria,,It seems the safest bet for our relationship. No one has to nag anyone else.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Rin,,Yes! And we can track the invoice clearly so nobody is out of pocket.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think that would be the most peaceful way.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
