50,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The options are Standing Assignments, a Fixed Weekly Rota, or a Paid Cleaning Service. I vote for the service.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Mio,,I can't do Standing Assignments if usage is uneven. I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service too.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"To avoid the fate of the previous tenants, I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Rin,,I love the idea of a professional invoice! Paid Cleaning Service for me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I also vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
